# Build-time settings (Vite envs, baked into the build).
#
# Dev builds only: prefill the connect screen's workspace field with a local
# instance so you don't retype it. Release builds ignore this — users name
# their own workspace ({sub}.zebu.work), and plain http is only accepted for
# loopback hosts there.
# VITE_ZEBU_WORKSPACE=http://127.0.0.1:8003
